From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Fri May 26 16:28:18 2023
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Fri, 26 May 2023 16:28:18 +0000
Subject: Re: the leading minor of order 1 is not positive definite
Message-ID: <pnuGo7dLPOo.yvWjaQ2GAAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <pnuGo7dLPOo.Hfq3Y1WFAAAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
